-- =====================================================
-- SECTION 6: BUSINESS INTERPRETATION
-- =====================================================
-- 1. Item-backed order counts use fact_orders.has_item_records.
-- 2. AOV is for delivered, item-backed orders and uses
--    recorded item prices + freight; it is not revenue.
-- 3. Reconciliation mismatch rate excludes orders that
--    lack item or payment records.
-- 4. Delivery percentages use correctly scoped denominators.
-- 5. Eight delivered-status orders without an actual
--    delivery date remain visible in coverage exceptions.
-- 6. Written feedback uses REVIEW-RECORD grain; records
--    with no text may still contain a valid numeric score.
-- 7. Purchase Date filters represent order-purchase cohorts.
-- 8. Product and Seller do not automatically filter
--    order-level financial/reconciliation metrics.
-- 9. Ratios use DIVIDE and return BLANK for zero denominator.

-- =====================================================
-- END OF FILE
